iJstorivaû. 3Inacon deú twðn 1Iliakwðn eæsthsan eJptakosivoiû
presbeuveiin. 2Ellhnikwðn deú filosovfwn, oåû tivû pote høn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0042" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0042B"></COL> Auctior idem est  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejkeiðnoû</FOREIGN>  voce,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>høn ejkeiðnoû ajnhúr.</FOREIGN></NOTE> 
