Mukhvnaû metateqeivshû,
diegevnonto basivleiðû oiåde</FOREIGN></CAPTION> <GL.TERM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Perseuúû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0086" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0086D"></COL> Proxime habet Syncellus  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sthenelum,</HI>  quem editi
