 <P COM="0329"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Zacarivaû oJ profhvthû . . . uJpoú 1Iwaúû basilevwû ajnhérevqh.</FOREIGN> Ex Chronic. Pasch. pag. 81.</P> 

