37. (Aventinus
 <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0330" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0330A"></COL> Scaliger legit  <HI REND="ITALIC">Aremuli:</HI>  tum, quod sane vitiosum
est, et contra mss. fidem, tacet  <HI REND="ITALIC">major,</HI>  ubi dicitur,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">major filius.</HI>  Historiam repete ex Eutropio, ex
