VIII,</HI> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0330" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0330A"></COL> Verior scriptura est  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pherecles,</HI>  ferme ut in primo
