VIII,</HI> 
 <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0330" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0330A"></COL> Perperam legit Scaliger  <HI REND="ITALIC">Aristodemus,</HI>  et in Graecis
Collectaneis  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Aristovdhmoû</FOREIGN> : nec recte codices duo
Palatini  <HI REND="ITALIC">Restomedes,</HI>  editi vetustiores  <HI REND="ITALIC">Aristhemedes.</HI> 
Videsis Diodorum apud Syncellum pag. 143, ubi solis
tamen annis triginta regnasse ille dicitur: sed et
 <COL N="0331A"></COL> alio apud eumdem loco, quem laudamus in Fragmentis,
anni tantummodo  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>la'</FOREIGN>  ascribebantur: reposuimus
autem  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>le',</FOREIGN>  ex Goaro.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ARISTOMEDES,
an.</HI> 
