 <P COM="0331"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Touð 1Iouvda ia', ejbasivleusen 1AMASIAS eæth kq'.</FOREIGN>  Ex Syncell.
pag. 159, et Chronic. Pasch. pag. 82.</P> 

