 <P COM="0447"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Pivndaroû . . . melopoioúû ejgnwrivzeto.</FOREIGN>  Ex Sync. p. 202.</P> 

 <P COM="0447"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Qemistoklhðû eijû Pevrsaû feuvgei.</FOREIGN>  Syncell. p. 203.</P> 

 <P COM="0447"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Sofoklhðû tragwédopoioúû prwðton uJpedeivxato.</FOREIGN>  Syncell.
ibidem.</P> 

 <P COM="0447"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1En thðé 1Rwvmhé Souniva parqevnoû fqareiðsa katwruvgh
 <COL N="0448"></COL> zwðsa.</FOREIGN>  Syncell. pag. 202.</P> 

 <P COM="0448"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Eujripivdhû ejgnwrivzeto.</FOREIGN>  Chron. Pasc. pag. 130.</P> 

 <P COM="0448"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Hrovdotoû iJstoriogravfoû ejgnwrivzeto.</FOREIGN>  Chron. Pasch.
