1Iwsedevk× høn deú oJ 3Esdraû grammateuúû novmwn iJerwðn didavskaloû
ejpifanhúû twðn ajpoú Babulwnivaû eijû 1Ioudaivan
ejpanelqovntwn.</FOREIGN>  Syncell. pag. 198.</P> 

 <P COM="0451"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Empedoklhðû kaiú Parmenivdhû fusikoiú filovsofoi ejgnwrivzonto.
 <COL N="0452"></COL> Zhvnwn kaiú 2Hravkleitoû oJ skoteinoúû hækmazon.</FOREIGN> Syncell. pag. 203.</P> 

