oæntwn 2Upavtwn.</FOREIGN>  Scaliger ex Syncell. pag. 203.</P> 

 <P COM="0453"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Aqhnaiðoi kaiú Lakedaimovnioi spondaúû ejpoihvsanto proúû
ajllhvlouû triakontouvteiû.</FOREIGN>  Syncell. 197.</P> 

