pag. 207.</P> 

 <P COM="0465"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Aijguptivwn b', ejbasivleuse TEWS b'.</FOREIGN>  Eusebius
apud Syncell. pag. 62.</P> 

 <P COM="0465"><COL N="0466"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Elivkh</FOREIGN>  [Al.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Elivla] kaiú Bouðra povleiû ejn (1Acaièaé, hætoi)
Peloponnhvswé katepovqhsan megavlwé seismwðé.</FOREIGN>  Syncell.
pag. 206, et Chron. Pasch. pag. 135.</P> 

