Babulwðni.</FOREIGN>  Chronic. Pasch. pag. 137.</P> 

 <P COM="0475"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Lusivmacoû . . . Qravékhû te kaiú CerjrJwnhvsou thðû loiphðû
basileuvei.</FOREIGN>  Syncell. pag. 212.</P> 

 <P COM="0475"><COL N="0476"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Agaqoklhðû ejn Sourakouvsaiû ejturavnnhsen.</FOREIGN>  Syncell.
p. 219.</P> 

