 <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0483" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0483A"></COL> Huic solos  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijkosieptaú,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">viginti septem,</HI>  regni annos
