 <COL N="0500"></COL> ejpanhðlqen, 1Onivaû deú oJ ajrciereuúû diapravttetai fugadeuqhðnai
toún Sivmwna.</FOREIGN>  Scaliger ex lib. II Machabaeor.
cap. 3.</P> 

 <P COM="0500"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Urkanoúû 1Iwshvpou paiðû strathgouð twðn 1Ioudaivwn
proúû Ptolemaiðon ejlqwún, kalwðû uJpedevcqh. OiJ deú ajdelfoiú
