twðé Filomhtori diakrivnontai periú twðn par1 eJkatevrwé
 <COL N="0510"></COL> mevrei timwmevnwn iJerwðn, kaiú nikwðsin 1Ioudaiðoi</FOREIGN>  Chronic.
