 <P COM="0519"><COL N="0520"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Aristovbouloû uiJoúû 1Iwavnqou . . . proúû thðé ajrcierosuvnhé
diavdhma perievqeto basilikoún prwðtoû . . . metaú eæth upd'
