ejgnwrivzonto.</FOREIGN></P> 

 <P COM="0623"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Apollwvnioû Stwiçkoúû Calkhdovnioû, kaiú Basilivdhû Skuqopolivthû×
oußtoi kaiú didavskaloi Oujhrhsivmou Kaivsaroû
gegovnasi</FOREIGN> . Idem ibidem.</P> 

 <P COM="0623"><COL N="0624"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Krhvskhû Kunikoúû filovsofoû 1Ioustivnwé twðé kaq1 hJmaðû
filosovfwé toún marturikoún suneskeuvase qavnaton ejlegcovmenoû
