qevaû pantoivaû, parevscon, tavte dhmovsia ajnhðkan, kaiú touúû
twðn crewðn cavrtaû ejpiú thðû 2Rwmanisivaû ajgoraðû katevflexan×
novmouû kaiú diatavxeiû euø suneidovteû ajnenewvsanto.</FOREIGN> Idem pag. 281.</P> 

 <P COM="0631"><COL N="0632"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kovmmodoû uJpoú thðû sugklhvtou Sebastoúû ajnerjrJhvqh.</FOREIGN> Syncell. pag. 282.</P> 

