 <P COM="0647"><COL N="0648"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Omoivwû deú kaiú Babulaðû thðû 1Antiocevwn twðé touð marturivou
drovmwé ejteleiwvqh× Meq1 oÝn 1Antioceivaû hJgeiðtai
