 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Fwnhú hjkouvsqh ejk twðn ajduvtwn,</FOREIGN>  a quo stat Cedrenus.</P> <P COM="1019">(Ibid.)  <HI REND="ITALIC">Memoratus. Supradictus</HI>  O., L., Vi., Fa.,
