et florebat tempore Severi.</P> <P COM="1063">(Ibid.)  <HI REND="ITALIC">Oenomanus. Hinomaus</HI>  L.;  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hynomaus</HI>  Pi.</P> <P COM="1063">(Ibid.)  <HI REND="ITALIC">Alexandrina Ecclesia,</HI>  etc. Hic Justus juste
